  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, the warrior poet learns how to twist the meaning of his poetry by interjecting a different kireji at the last moment. He gains an inflection. An inflection is like a haiku, except that it has a kireji and no subjects. Whenever the warrior poet would execute a kireji, he may use the kireji native to the haiku he is orating, or he may execute the kireji prepared in his inflection.</p>\n<p>The warrior poet may execute his inflection up to twice per day, plus an additional time per day at 6th level and every four warrior poet levels thereafter (max 6 uses at 18th level).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/warrior-poet#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
